      "title": "Persistence",
      "items": [
        "A DATABASE_URL selects Postgres; without it the app falls back to local SQLite.",
        "Sanitized screenshot bytes go to Supabase Storage when SUPABASE_URL and a service-role key are set, otherwise to local disk under opaque keys.",
        "The local classifier assigns metadata labels without a Gemini call."
      ]
